Content
-------
The guides, PDFs and images under docs/ (other than those noted below) are © Norman Williams,
hamradiosouthernrepeaters.co.uk, and are reproduced with his permission (AnyTone UK User Group
post, 22/11/2026: "If anyone wants to copy the Anytone page and host it, feel free to do so.").

The AT-D868/878UV and AT-D578UV "mods, hints & tips" pages (docs/mods/868-878, docs/mods/578)
are © Jason Reilly VK7ZJA 2018–2022 (silent key, January 2023). They are reproduced unchanged from
Norman Williams' preserved copy. They will be removed on request from his family.

Third-party manuals under docs/archive/third-party/ remain the property of their publishers. They are
archived for reference only, and each one's source and retrieval date are listed on the Manuals page.
They will be removed on request.

